# std-avrac's cases that END THE SUITE'S PROCESS on the program layer, one a line, by the first line
# the runner says after `avra: while running `. Every case after one in its row never runs, so the
# gate fails on a trap this file does not list. Each has its place and the layer's words above it.
# Take a line away the day its case runs to an answer, then run its file: the cases past it report.
#
# packages/std-avrac/src/features/components/tests/components_mechanical_test.av:168
#   `record_signature` (…component) was asked while it was being answered, under program_refused ->
#   file_erring -> law_findings -> item_refusals -> record_signature -> resolved -> generated_names -> file_generated
features/components adversarial — mechanical / keyword-replace — must be diagnosed or a valid program / component component ( x : x , x : x , ) { x : x = x } 
